# Gajim (GTK 4): notifications, tray, its own GApplication names (single instance).
# GTK 4 uses the portals it can see: the file chooser (send a file, avatar, save a received file:
# one file each, so the document portal fits). Links: Gajim opens them with GIO, which outside Flatpak
# does not use the OpenURI portal; "env links-tor" makes GIO's default Tor Browser (which Gajim's AppArmor
# profile starts, Px) instead of the I2P Browser, which it may not start. portal-links stays for GTK's
# own launchers, which may use the portal.
include notify
include tray
own org.gajim.Gajim
own org.gajim.Gajim.*
include portal-files
include portal-links
env links-tor
# its gpg-agent's passphrase prompt (OpenPGP keys with a passphrase, e.g. imported from Kleopatra)
include pinentry
